{"seq":1,"slug":"retrosynthetic-analysis","title":"逆合成分析（Retrosynthetic Analysis）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/synthesis-strategy/retrosynthetic-analysis","wordCount":3002,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"逆合成分析-retrosynthetic-analysis\">逆合成分析（Retrosynthetic Analysis）</h1><h2 id=\"引言\">引言</h2><p>1990 年，瑞典皇家科学院将诺贝尔化学奖授予哈佛大学的 Elias James Corey 教授，表彰他&quot;对有机合成理论和方法论的发展&quot;——其核心贡献正是逆合成分析（Retrosynthetic Analysis）的系统化建立。Corey 从 1957 年开始发展这一思想，到 20 世纪 60 年代正式提出&quot;逆合成&quot;术语和完整的方法学框架，并率先将计算机辅助应用于合成路线设计。</p>\n<p>逆合成分析的核心思想惊人地简洁：<strong>不是从起始原料向前推导，而是从目标分子向后拆解</strong>。通过识别目标分子中可以断开的&quot;战略键&quot;，将复杂结构逐步简化为更小的前体分子，反复进行直到追溯到商业可得的简单化合物。这种&quot;终点驱动&quot;的思维方式将有机合成从直觉艺术提升为可系统教授的方法学。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>逆合成分析是一种倒推的搜索算法</strong>：把目标分子（TM）当作问题，把&quot;断键&quot;当作把大问题拆成小问题的操作，一直递归到&quot;原子库&quot;——那些可以买到的简单原料。它的价值在于把&quot;怎样合成这个分子&quot;这个开放难题，转化为一系列有规则可循的局部决策。</p>\n<p>掌握它需要理解四个基本构件：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>断键（Disconnection）</strong>：在目标分子中想象切断一根键，得到两个片段。这不是真实反应，而是对&quot;正向该用哪类成键反应&quot;的逆向提问。</li>\n<li><strong>合成子（Synthon）与合成等价物（Synthetic Equivalent）</strong>：合成子是断键产生的理想化带电荷片段（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>R</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{R}^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），实验里必须用真实试剂（如 RMgBr）来提供同样的反应性——后者就是前者的合成等价物。</li>\n<li><strong>转化（Transform）</strong>：每一次断键都对应一个正向反应，逆合成分析的本质是把目标结构与已知反应的产物模式做匹配。</li>\n<li><strong>1,X 关系</strong>：目标分子中两个官能团之间的碳原子间距，直接揭示最适用的成键反应（1,3 → Aldol；1,4 → Michael；1,5 → Robinson 环化）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>评价一条路线的标准</strong>（而非只看&quot;能否拆开&quot;）：步骤数、总收率（各步收率之积）、选择性、原料可得性、条件温和与安全、可放大性。同一目标常有多种断键方案，路线设计的创造力就体现在权衡这些指标后选优。</p>\n<p><strong>常见误解</strong>：把逆合成箭头 ⇒ 当作真实反应去写机理。⇒ 只表示&quot;可由……制得&quot;的逻辑关系，其上的片段是合成子而非真实存在的离子；把它们落成可执行的实验方案，需要额外把每个合成子映射到合成等价物的步骤。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  TM[&quot;目标分子 TM&quot;] --&gt; D1[&quot;断键 → 合成子&quot;]&#10;  TM --&gt; D2[&quot;FGI → 改变官能团&quot;]&#10;  D1 --&gt; SE[&quot;合成子 → 合成等价物&quot;]&#10;  D1 --&gt; REL[&quot;识别 1,X 关系&quot;]&#10;  REL --&gt; R13[&quot;1,3 → Aldol/Claisen&quot;]&#10;  REL --&gt; R14[&quot;1,4 → Michael 加成&quot;]&#10;  REL --&gt; R15[&quot;1,5 → Robinson 环化&quot;]&#10;  SE --&gt; P1[&quot;前体 A (商业可得?)&quot;]&#10;  SE --&gt; P2[&quot;前体 B (需再拆解)&quot;]&#10;  P2 --&gt; TM&#10;  D2 --&gt; PRE[&quot;创造断键机会&quot;]&#10;  PRE --&gt; D1\">graph TD\n  TM[\"目标分子 TM\"] --&gt; D1[\"断键 → 合成子\"]\n  TM --&gt; D2[\"FGI → 改变官能团\"]\n  D1 --&gt; SE[\"合成子 → 合成等价物\"]\n  D1 --&gt; REL[\"识别 1,X 关系\"]\n  REL --&gt; R13[\"1,3 → Aldol/Claisen\"]\n  REL --&gt; R14[\"1,4 → Michael 加成\"]\n  REL --&gt; R15[\"1,5 → Robinson 环化\"]\n  SE --&gt; P1[\"前体 A (商业可得?)\"]\n  SE --&gt; P2[\"前体 B (需再拆解)\"]\n  P2 --&gt; TM\n  D2 --&gt; PRE[\"创造断键机会\"]\n  PRE --&gt; D1</pre><h2 id=\"逆合成分析的基本概念\">逆合成分析的基本概念</h2><h3 id=\"断键-disconnection\">断键（Disconnection）</h3><p>断键是逆合成分析的核心操作——在目标分子中选择一根键，想象将其&quot;断开&quot;，得到两个更简单的片段。这些片段称为<strong>合成子</strong>（Synthon）——即在正向合成中能通过已知反应结合的理想化学物种。</p>\n<p>用双箭头符号 ⇒ 表示逆合成方向（从产物到前体），区别于正向反应的单箭头 →。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>目标分子 (TM)</mtext><mo>⟹</mo><mtext>前体 A</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>前体 B</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{目标分子 (TM)} \\Longrightarrow \\text{前体 A} + \\text{前体 B}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">目标分子</span><span class=\"mord\"> (TM)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">前体</span><span class=\"mord\"> A</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">前体</span><span class=\"mord\"> B</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"合成子与合成等价物\">合成子与合成等价物</h3><p><strong>合成子</strong>（Synthon）是逆合成分析中的理论概念——它可能是真实存在的化学物种，也可能只是一个带电荷的理想片段。例如：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>断开 C—C 键，一侧为碳正离子片段（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>R</mtext><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{R}^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），另一侧为碳负离子片段（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>R’</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{R&#x27;}^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8557em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R’</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8557em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>R</mtext><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{R}^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的合成等价物可以是卤代烃 RX（在 SN2 中作为亲电体）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>R’</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{R&#x27;}^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8557em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R’</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8557em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的合成等价物可以是 Grignard 试剂 R&#39;MgBr 或有机锂 R&#39;Li</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>合成等价物</strong>（Synthetic Equivalent）是实验中实际使用的试剂，它提供了合成子所需的反应性。</p>\n<p>常见合成子-合成等价物对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>合成子</th>\n<th>极性</th>\n<th>合成等价物</th>\n<th>反应类型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>R</mtext><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{R}^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>亲电</td>\n<td>R—X, R—OTs</td>\n<td>SN2 底物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>R</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{R}^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>亲核</td>\n<td>RMgBr, RLi, RCu</td>\n<td>有机金属试剂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>RCO</mtext><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RCO}^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RCO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>酰基正离子</td>\n<td>RCOCl, (RCO)₂O</td>\n<td>酰化剂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo></msup><msub><mtext>CH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>COR</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^-\\text{CH}_2\\text{COR}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9213em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">COR</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>烯醇负离子</td>\n<td>LDA + 酮 → 烯醇负离子</td>\n<td>Aldol, 烷基化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>=CH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{=CH}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">=CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>碳烯</td>\n<td>Wittig 试剂 Ph₃P=CH₂</td>\n<td>Wittig 反应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo></msup><mtext>C≡CH</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^-\\text{C≡CH}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C≡CH</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>炔负离子</td>\n<td>NaNH₂ + RC≡CH</td>\n<td>炔基化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"转化-transform\">转化（Transform）</h3><p>转化是断键操作对应的逆向反应概念。每一步断键都意味着在正向合成中需要执行一步特定的反应（transform）。</p>\n<p>例如：目标分子中存在 β-羟基酮结构 → 逆合成断键为两个醛/酮 → 对应的正向反应是 Aldol 反应。</p>\n<p>识别目标分子中的特征结构模式，并将其与已知反应的产物模式匹配——这是逆合成分析的核心技能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"逆合成分析的策略层次\">逆合成分析的策略层次</h2><h3 id=\"策略-1-官能团互变-functional-group-interconversion-fgi\">策略 1：官能团互变（Functional Group Interconversion, FGI）</h3><p>不断键，但改变官能团类型以简化问题或创造断键机会：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>目标含醇 → 逆向思考可来自酮的还原</li>\n<li>目标含胺 → 逆向思考可来自硝基的还原或亚胺的还原</li>\n<li>目标含烯烃 → 逆向思考可来自消除反应</li>\n</ul>\n<p>FGI 本身不简化分子骨架，但它改变官能团使后续断键成为可能。</p>\n<h3 id=\"策略-2-c-c-键断裂\">策略 2：C—C 键断裂</h3><p>这是逆合成中最关键的操作——每断一根 C—C 键，分子的复杂度就显著降低。</p>\n<p>选择断键位置的指导原则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>优先断开连接两个官能团的键（这类键通常对应已知的 C—C 键形成反应）</li>\n<li>寻找分子中的对称性——对称键的断裂可以得到两个相同的前体（简化路线）</li>\n<li>断键后得到的片段应尽可能是商业可得的或容易制备的</li>\n<li>利用&quot;1,X 关系&quot;模式识别适用的反应类型</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"1-x-关系模式\">1,X 关系模式</h3><p>目标分子中两个官能团之间的碳原子距离揭示了最适合的 C—C 键形成反应：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>对应反应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1,2-关系</td>\n<td>相邻碳上各有官能团</td>\n<td>频哪醇偶联, McMurry 反应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1,3-关系</td>\n<td>间隔一个碳</td>\n<td>Aldol 反应, Claisen 缩合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1,4-关系</td>\n<td>间隔两个碳</td>\n<td>Michael 加成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1,5-关系</td>\n<td>间隔三个碳</td>\n<td>Michael + Aldol（Robinson 环化）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>识别目标分子中的 1,X 关系，是选择断键位置最重要的技巧之一。</p>\n<h3 id=\"策略-3-环的断裂与构建\">策略 3：环的断裂与构建</h3><p>环状结构的逆合成需要特殊考虑：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Diels-Alder 逆合成</strong>：六元环可逆向拆为双烯和亲双烯体</li>\n<li><strong>Robinson 环化逆合成</strong>：含酮基的六元环可拆为甲基乙烯基酮 + 环酮的烯醇</li>\n<li><strong>环氧化物开环逆合成</strong>：含 1,2-二醇或 β-氨基醇的结构可追溯到环氧化物</li>\n<li><strong>分子内 Aldol 逆合成</strong>：六元或五元环酮来自链状二酮</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战-逆合成分析范例\">实战：逆合成分析范例</h2><h3 id=\"范例-1-合成-4-苯基-2-丁酮\">范例 1：合成 4-苯基-2-丁酮</h3><p>目标：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>5</mn></msub><msub><mtext>CH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>CH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>COCH</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C}_6\\text{H}_5\\text{CH}_2\\text{CH}_2\\text{COCH}_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">COCH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>分析：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>识别 1,3-关系：苯基在 C4，酮基在 C2 → 不是标准 1,3 模式</li>\n<li>考虑 FGI：酮 → 可来自仲醇氧化 → 仲醇来自 Grignard</li>\n<li>断键选择 A：断 C3—C4 键 → <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>5</mn></msub><msubsup><mtext>CH</mtext><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C}_6\\text{H}_5\\text{CH}_2^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0916em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup><msub><mtext>CH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>COCH</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+\\text{CH}_2\\text{COCH}_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9213em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">COCH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><ul>\n<li>合成等价物：苄基 Grignard 试剂 + 环氧乙烷（后氧化）→ 步骤复杂</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>断键选择 B：断 C2—C3 键 → <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>5</mn></msub><msub><mtext>CH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mtext>CH</mtext><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C}_6\\text{H}_5\\text{CH}_2\\text{CH}_2^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0916em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup><msub><mtext>COCH</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+\\text{COCH}_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9213em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">COCH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><ul>\n<li>合成等价物：苯乙基铜锂 + 乙酰氯 → 可行</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>更优路径：Wittig → 用苯乙醛 + Wittig 试剂构建 → 再加氢</li>\n</ol>\n<p>实际最优路线：苯乙烯 + 甲基乙烯基酮（Michael 加成，共轭 1,4-加成产物）</p>\n<h3 id=\"范例-2-aldol-逆合成\">范例 2：Aldol 逆合成</h3><p>目标：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CH</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mtext>CH(OH)CH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>CHO</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CH}_3\\text{CH(OH)CH}_2\\text{CHO}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH(OH)CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CHO</span></span></span></span></span></span>（3-羟基丁醛）</p>\n<p>分析：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>识别：β-羟基醛 → 经典 Aldol 产物模式！</li>\n<li>逆合成：在 α-β 键处断裂 → 两分子乙醛</li>\n<li>正向合成：2 CH₃CHO → NaOH → 3-羟基丁醛</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这是最简洁的一步逆合成——识别产物模式后直接对应已知反应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"计算机辅助合成设计-casp\">计算机辅助合成设计（CASP）</h2><h3 id=\"从-corey-到-ai\">从 Corey 到 AI</h3><p>Corey 在 20 世纪 60 年代就开创了计算机辅助合成设计的先河——他的 LHASA（Logic and Heuristics Applied to Synthetic Analysis）程序是第一个实用的逆合成分析软件。</p>\n<p>现代 CASP 工具的演进：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>LHASA</strong>（1969）：基于规则的专家系统</li>\n<li><strong>SYNTHIA</strong>（Chematica，2020 收购于 Merck）：整合了大量转化规则和启发式策略</li>\n<li><strong>AI 驱动方法</strong>（2018 至今）：深度学习模型（如 Segler et al. 2018, Nature）从数百万已知反应中学习逆合成模式，搜索效率远超传统方法</li>\n</ul>\n<p>2024-2025 年，基于 Transformer 架构的逆合成 AI（如 RetroStar、AiZynthFinder）已经能在数秒内为中等复杂度的药物分子提出多条可行合成路线——尽管最终的路线选择和实验验证仍然需要化学家的判断。</p>\n<h3 id=\"合成路线评价标准\">合成路线评价标准</h3><p>无论人工还是计算机设计，一条好的合成路线应满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>步骤数少</strong>（理想 ≤ 10 步）——每一步都有产率损失</li>\n<li><strong>收率高</strong>（总收率 = 各步收率之积）</li>\n<li><strong>选择性好</strong>（减少副产物和分离难度）</li>\n<li><strong>原料廉价易得</strong></li>\n<li><strong>条件温和、安全、环保</strong>（原子经济性、减少有害废物）</li>\n<li><strong>可规模化</strong>（实验室路线可能不适合工业放大）</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"经典全合成赏析\">经典全合成赏析</h2><h3 id=\"维生素-b-woodward-eschenmoser-1972\">维生素 B₁₂（Woodward-Eschenmoser，1972）</h3><p>Robert B. Woodward（1965 年诺贝尔化学奖得主）和 Albert Eschenmoser 合作完成的维生素 B₁₂ 全合成是有机合成史上最伟大的成就之一。该分子含有 9 个手性中心和独特的咕啉环系，全合成耗时 12 年、约 100 步反应，动员了两个实验室近百名研究生。</p>\n<p>这一合成的价值不在于提供维生素 B₁₂ 的实用制备方法（微生物发酵更经济），而在于验证了结构鉴定的正确性、发展了大量新反应方法，并证明了有机合成能够征服任何分子复杂度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"紫杉醇-taxol-全合成\">紫杉醇（Taxol）全合成</h3><p>紫杉醇是从太平洋紫杉树皮中提取的抗癌药物，其复杂的四环结构（含 11 个手性中心）吸引了全球数十个课题组投入全合成竞赛。1994 年，Holton 和 Nicolaou 几乎同时完成了紫杉醇的全合成，分别使用了不同的逆合成策略和关键反应。</p>\n<p>这一案例展示了逆合成分析的核心价值：同一目标分子可以有完全不同的断键方案，每种方案各有优劣，化学家的创造力在于选择最优路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章小结\">本章小结</h2><p>逆合成分析是有机合成的&quot;元策略&quot;——它不是一个具体反应，而是一种思维方式。掌握逆合成分析意味着能够面对任何目标分子进行系统的合成规划。</p>\n<p>核心工具：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>断键操作</strong>：在关键位置切断 C—C 键或 C—杂原子键，得到合成子</li>\n<li><strong>合成等价物</strong>：将理论合成子映射为实际试剂</li>\n<li><strong>FGI</strong>：官能团互变为断键创造条件</li>\n<li><strong>1,X 模式识别</strong>：两个官能团的距离揭示适用反应</li>\n<li><strong>收敛式路线</strong>：多个片段在后期汇聚，比线性路线效率高</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Corey 在其诺贝尔演讲中说：&quot;化学合成的逻辑（The Logic of Chemical Synthesis）不仅是一门科学，也是人类创造力的最高体现之一。&quot; 逆合成分析将这种创造力系统化、可传授——这正是其革命性意义所在。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"逆合成分析（Retrosynthetic Analysis）","id":"逆合成分析-retrosynthetic-analysis"},{"level":2,"text":"引言","id":"引言"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"逆合成分析的基本概念","id":"逆合成分析的基本概念"},{"level":3,"text":"断键（Disconnection）","id":"断键-disconnection"},{"level":3,"text":"合成子与合成等价物","id":"合成子与合成等价物"},{"level":3,"text":"转化（Transform）","id":"转化-transform"},{"level":2,"text":"逆合成分析的策略层次","id":"逆合成分析的策略层次"},{"level":3,"text":"策略 1：官能团互变（Functional Group Interconversion, FGI）","id":"策略-1-官能团互变-functional-group-interconversion-fgi"},{"level":3,"text":"策略 2：C—C 键断裂","id":"策略-2-c-c-键断裂"},{"level":3,"text":"1,X 关系模式","id":"1-x-关系模式"},{"level":3,"text":"策略 3：环的断裂与构建","id":"策略-3-环的断裂与构建"},{"level":2,"text":"实战：逆合成分析范例","id":"实战-逆合成分析范例"},{"level":3,"text":"范例 1：合成 4-苯基-2-丁酮","id":"范例-1-合成-4-苯基-2-丁酮"},{"level":3,"text":"范例 2：Aldol 逆合成","id":"范例-2-aldol-逆合成"},{"level":2,"text":"计算机辅助合成设计（CASP）","id":"计算机辅助合成设计-casp"},{"level":3,"text":"从 Corey 到 AI","id":"从-corey-到-ai"},{"level":3,"text":"合成路线评价标准","id":"合成路线评价标准"},{"level":2,"text":"经典全合成赏析","id":"经典全合成赏析"},{"level":3,"text":"维生素 B₁₂（Woodward-Eschenmoser，1972）","id":"维生素-b-woodward-eschenmoser-1972"},{"level":3,"text":"紫杉醇（Taxol）全合成","id":"紫杉醇-taxol-全合成"},{"level":2,"text":"本章小结","id":"本章小结"}],"prev":{"title":"胺类与杂环化合物（Amines and Heterocyclic Compounds）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/aromatic-carbonyl/amine-heterocyclic"},"next":{"title":"保护基策略（Protecting Group Strategy）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/synthesis-strategy/protecting-groups"}}